msgid "Workspace: {root}\n\nThis stores only the broker.preview grant for this .isyroot. The selected project still needs its own workspace.files.read grant. Preview reads recipe metadata and hashes, does not launch Docker, and cannot start a container."
msgstr "工作区：{root}\n\n这只会为此 .isyroot 保存 broker.preview 授权。所选项目仍需要自己的 workspace.files.read 授权。预览只读取配方元数据和哈希，不会启动 Docker，也无法启动容器。"

